                'tags'           => ['silver rings', 'silver ring designs', '925 sterling silver ring', 'silver ring for men', 'silver ring for women', 'oxidised silver ring', 'silver ring price'],
                'featured_image' => 'blog/blog-silver-rings.jpg',
                'excerpt'        => 'Silver rings offer stunning style without breaking the bank. From minimalist sterling silver bands to bold oxidised statement rings, discover the best silver ring designs for men and women under ₹5,000 in India.',
                'content'        => '<h2>Why Silver Rings Are Having a Massive Moment</h2><p>Silver jewellery has shed its image as gold\'s cheaper cousin. Today, silver rings are a deliberate style choice — favoured by fashion-forward men and women who appreciate contemporary design, minimalist aesthetics, and the ability to own multiple pieces without financial stress. With 925 sterling silver rings available from ₹500 to ₹5,000, you can build an impressive ring collection for the price of a single gold ring.</p><h2>Understanding Silver Purity</h2><p>Not all silver is the same:</p><ul><li><strong>999 Fine Silver:</strong> 99.9% pure silver. Too soft for jewellery. Bends and scratches easily.</li><li><strong>925 Sterling Silver:</strong> 92.5% silver + 7.5% copper or zinc. The industry standard for silver jewellery. Durable, polishable, and beautiful. Always look for the 925 hallmark.</li><li><strong>800 Silver:</strong> 80% silver. Lower quality. Tarnishes faster. Avoid for rings.</li><li><strong>German Silver:</strong> Contains NO actual silver. It is a nickel-copper-zinc alloy. Can cause skin reactions. Definitely avoid.</li></ul><h2>Best Silver Ring Designs for Women</h2><h3>Minimalist Bands (₹400 - ₹1,200)</h3><p>Thin, sleek bands in polished or matte finish. Stack them, twist them, mix metals — minimalist silver bands are the building blocks of modern ring styling. Rose gold-plated and two-tone options add variety without the gold price tag.</p><h3>Gemstone Silver Rings (₹1,000 - ₹3,500)</h3><p>Sterling silver paired with semi-precious stones like moonstone, amethyst, turquoise, garnet, or labradorite. Each stone adds colour, meaning, and personality. Moonstone silver rings are particularly popular for their ethereal glow.</p><h3>Oxidised Silver Rings (₹600 - ₹2,500)</h3><p>Intentionally darkened silver that highlights intricate patterns. Boho, tribal, and floral designs in oxidised silver are a favourite with jeans, kurtis, and Indo-western outfits. They have a handcrafted, artisanal feel that gold cannot replicate.</p><h2>Best Silver Ring Designs for Men</h2><h3>Signet Rings (₹800 - ₹3,000)</h3><p>A flat-topped ring traditionally used for personal seals. Modern signet rings feature minimalist engravings, initials, or symbolic motifs. Worn on the pinky or ring finger, they add quiet sophistication to any look.</p><h3>Skull & Biker Rings (₹1,200 - ₹5,000)</h3><p>Bold, heavy rings with skulls, Celtic knots, eagles, or gothic patterns. These are statement pieces for men who want their jewellery to make noise. Often 15-30 grams of solid sterling silver.</p><h3>Celtic & Band Rings (₹600 - ₹2,000)</h3><p>Braided, twisted, or patterned bands inspired by Celtic knotwork. Masculine without being aggressive. Perfect for daily wear at the office or college.</p><h2>Silver Ring Care: Preventing Tarnish</h2><p>Silver tarnishes when exposed to air and moisture — this is normal, not a defect. Prevention and cleaning are simple:</p><ul><li>Wear your silver rings regularly — skin oils actually help prevent tarnish</li><li>Store in anti-tarnish pouches or zip-lock bags with a silica gel packet</li><li>Clean with a silver polishing cloth (available for ₹100-₹200)</li><li>For heavy tarnish, use a baking soda paste and warm water</li><li>Remove before swimming, showering, or applying hand cream</li><li>Avoid contact with perfume, bleach, and rubber bands</li></ul><blockquote>Silver rings let you express your style without overthinking your budget. Own five silver rings for the price of one gold ring and switch your look daily. Browse our sterling silver ring collection at Trendimus.</blockquote>',
                'is_published'   => true,
                'published_at'   => now()->subDays(16),
                'view_count'     => 1089,
