            [
                'title'          => 'Silver Bracelets for Men & Women: Chain, Cuff & Charm Bracelet Guide',
                'slug'           => 'silver-bracelets-chain-cuff-charm-guide',
                'category'       => 'Bangles & Bracelets',
                'tags'           => ['silver bracelet', 'silver bracelet for men', 'sterling silver bracelet', 'silver cuff bracelet', 'charm bracelet', 'silver chain bracelet', 'silver bracelet designs'],
                'featured_image' => 'blog/blog-silver-bracelets.jpg',
                'excerpt'        => 'Silver bracelets are the go-to wrist accessory for style-conscious men and women. From rugged chain bracelets to elegant cuffs and personalised charm bracelets, find the perfect silver bracelet for your style.',
                'content'        => '<h2>Silver Bracelets: The Wrist Accessory That Goes With Everything</h2><p>A silver bracelet is the most effortlessly cool piece of jewellery you can own. It works with a t-shirt and jeans, a business casual outfit, or traditional Indian wear. Unlike watches that serve a function, bracelets are pure self-expression. And in sterling silver, they are affordable enough to collect, stack, and gift without hesitation.</p><h2>Types of Silver Bracelets</h2><h3>Chain Bracelets (₹1,000 - ₹5,000)</h3><p>The most popular silver bracelet style. Available in Figaro, Cuban link, rope, curb, and box chain patterns. Chain bracelets come in various widths — thin 3mm chains for a subtle look, or thick 8-10mm chains for a bold statement. A well-made sterling silver chain bracelet with a secure lobster clasp is a daily-wear essential.</p><h3>Cuff Bracelets (₹1,500 - ₹6,000)</h3><p>Open-ended rigid bracelets that slip over the wrist without a clasp. Cuffs range from minimalist polished bands to heavily textured, hammered, or engraved designs. They are particularly popular with men — a silver cuff worn on the opposite wrist from your watch creates a balanced, styled look.</p><h3>Charm Bracelets (₹2,000 - ₹8,000)</h3><p>A chain bracelet with dangling charms that can be added over time. Each charm represents a memory, milestone, or interest. Popular charms include hearts, stars, initials, evil eye, Om symbol, Ganesha, and travel-themed pieces. Charm bracelets make excellent gifts because they grow with the wearer.</p><h3>Beaded Bracelets (₹500 - ₹3,000)</h3><p>Sterling silver beads strung on elastic or wire, often mixed with natural stone beads like lava rock, tiger eye, or turquoise. The casual, bohemian aesthetic works for both men and women. Stack multiple beaded bracelets in different colours for a festival-ready look.</p><h3>Kada / Bangle Style (₹2,000 - ₹7,000)</h3><p>Solid silver kadas are a staple in Sikh and Punjabi culture for men. Heavy, plain kadas in 925 silver weigh 30-80 grams and are worn daily as a mark of faith and identity. Women\'s silver kadas feature more ornate designs with filigree, gemstones, or enamel work.</p><h2>How to Choose the Right Bracelet Size</h2><p>Measure your wrist with a flexible tape measure, then add:</p><ul><li><strong>For a snug fit:</strong> Add 0.5 inches to your wrist measurement</li><li><strong>For a comfortable fit:</strong> Add 1 inch (most popular)</li><li><strong>For a loose fit:</strong> Add 1.5 inches</li></ul><p>Common men\'s sizes: 7.5-8.5 inches. Common women\'s sizes: 6.5-7.5 inches. When in doubt, go slightly larger — a bracelet that is too tight is uncomfortable, but a slightly loose one looks relaxed and stylish.</p><h2>Stacking Silver Bracelets</h2><p>Stacking multiple bracelets is a major trend. Here is how to do it right:</p><ul><li>Mix textures — combine a chain, a cuff, and a beaded bracelet</li><li>Vary widths — one thick statement piece anchored by thinner accent bracelets</li><li>Keep to odd numbers — 3 or 5 bracelets stack better visually than even numbers</li><li>Stay in one metal family — mixing silver with gold can look intentional but is harder to pull off</li></ul><blockquote>A silver bracelet is the simplest way to add personality to your wrist. Start with one that matches your everyday style and build from there. Explore sterling silver bracelets at Trendimus.</blockquote>',
                'is_published'   => true,
                'published_at'   => now()->subDays(14),
                'view_count'     => 654,
                'seo_data'       => [
                    'meta_title'       => 'Silver Bracelets: Chain, Cuff & Charm Bracelet Guide | Trendimus',
                    'meta_description' => 'Guide to silver bracelets for men & women. Chain, cuff, charm & beaded bracelets in 925 sterling silver. Sizing guide, stacking tips & prices in India.',
                ],
