                    'meta_title'       => 'Mangalsutra Designs 2026: Modern, Diamond & Traditional | Trendimus',
                    'meta_description' => 'Explore modern mangalsutra designs for 2026. Diamond, short, bracelet & traditional styles with prices. Regional variations, daily wear tips & buying guide.',
